      "text": "BiocharStorage in Soil Environments\r\nThis module details durability and monitoring requirements for biochar spreading and storage in\r\nsoil environments.\r\nStorage\r\nModule\r\nv1.2\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 1/72"
