    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "9.5.2 Project Boundary Mapping With Application Records\r\n9.6 Acceptable Evidence for Mixing With Organic Material (e.g., Compost)\r\n9.6.1 Mixing Facility Documentation\r\n9.6.2 Mixing Process Evidence\r\n9.7 Evidence When Biochar Is Sold to Third Parties\r\n9.7.1 Affidavits or Declarations\r\n9.7.2 Sales Documentation\r\n9.7.3 Mixing Process Evidence\r\n9.8 Guidance on Transport Emissions (only Applicable to Biochar Mixed With Organic Material, or Sold to Third Parties)\r\n9.9 Chain-Of-Custody Requirements\r\n9.10 Verification and Audit Guidance\r\n9.11 Optional Enhanced Evidence\r\n10 Acknowledgements\r\n11 Definitions and Acronyms\r\n12 Relevant Works\r\nFootnotes\r\nContributors\r\nChangelog\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 3/72"
