      "type": "text",
      "text": "PROPERTY EXPECTED UNIT THRESHOLD RECOMMENDED ANALYTICAL METHODOLOGY DESCRIPTION\r\nMONITORING\r\nFREQUENCY\r\nRECOM\r\nOR REQ\r\n%\r\n(weight/weight)\r\n–\r\nISO 29541:2025 or ISO 16948:2015 or\r\nASTM D5373-21\r\nThe carbon content of\r\napplied biochar is\r\nnecessary for the\r\ncalculation of and\r\nthus , in\r\naccordance with Section\r\n8.3 of the Biochar\r\nProduction and Storage\r\nProtocol. See Section\r\n8.3.1 of the Biochar\r\nProduction and Storage\r\nProtocol for carbon\r\ncontent sampling\r\nguidance.\r\nMeasure\r\nevery\r\nproduction\r\nbatch as per\r\nMethod A or\r\nB applicable,\r\nas defined in\r\nSection 8.3.2\r\nof the Biochar\r\nProduction\r\nand Storage\r\nProtocol.\r\nMinimum\r\nnumber of 3\r\nsamples per\r\nsampling.\r\nRequi\r\nMoisture Content\r\n%\r\n(weight/weight)\r\n– ISO 18134-1 or ASTM D1762-84\r\nThe moisture content of\r\napplied biochar is\r\nnecessary for the\r\nquantification of\r\nCO estored, in\r\naccordance with Section\r\n8.3 of the Biochar\r\nProduction and Storage\r\nProtocol. See Section\r\n8.3.1 of the Biochar\r\nProduction and Storage\r\nProtocol for carbon\r\ncontent sampling\r\nguidance.\r\nMeasure\r\nevery\r\nproduction\r\nbatch as per\r\nMethod A or\r\nB applicable,\r\nas defined in\r\nSection 8.3.2\r\nof the Biochar\r\nProduction\r\nand Storage\r\nProtocol.\r\nMinimum\r\nnumber of 3\r\nsamples per\r\nsampling.\r\nRequi\r\nInorganic Carbon\r\nContent ( )\r\n%\r\n(weight/weight)\r\n-\r\nISO 16948:2015 or ASTM D4373-02 or DIN\r\n51726: 2004-06\r\nMeasurement of\r\nin biochar is required to\r\naccurately differentiate\r\norganic carbon ( )\r\nfrom\r\n, which may include both\r\ninorganic and organic\r\nforms. Only organic\r\ncarbon is credited for\r\nunder this Protocol and\r\nModule.\r\nMeasure\r\nevery\r\nproduction\r\nbatch as per\r\nMethod A or\r\nB applicable,\r\nas defined in\r\nSection 8.3.2\r\nof the Biochar\r\nProduction\r\nand Storage\r\nProtocol.\r\nMinimum\r\nnumber of 3\r\nsamples per\r\nsampling.\r\nRequi\r\nTotal Hydrogen (H) %\r\n(weight/weight)\r\n- ISO 29541:2025 or ISO 16948:2015 or\r\nASTM D5373-21\r\nMeasurement of H is\r\nrequired to calculate the\r\nratio.\r\nMeasure\r\nevery\r\nproduction\r\nRequi\r\nTotal Carbon Content\r\nCorg\r\nCO2estored\r\n2\r\nCinorg\r\nCinorg\r\nCorg\r\nTotal Carbon Content\r\nH/Corg\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 12/72"
