      "type": "text",
      "text": "PARAMETER DESCRIPTION\r\nREQUIRED OR\r\nRECOMMENDED THRESHOLDS\r\nPARAMETER\r\nTYPE UNITS\r\nPROTOCOL OR MODULE\r\nREFERENCE DATA SOURCE\r\nInorganic Carbon\r\nContent ( )\r\nMeasurement of\r\nin biochar is required to\r\naccurately differentiate\r\norganic carbon\r\nfrom\r\n, which may include both\r\ninorganic and organic\r\nforms. Only is\r\ncredited for under this\r\nProtocol and Module.\r\nRequired - Measured\r\n% (weight\r\n/ weight)\r\n< Section 3.3 in the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical mea\r\nof inorganic ca\r\ncontent of app\r\nbiochar\r\nTotal Hydrogen (H)\r\nMeasurement of H is\r\nrequired to calculate the\r\nratio.\r\nRequired - Measured\r\n% (weight\r\n/ weight)\r\nEq. 3 in the Biochar\r\nStorage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical dete\r\nof hydrogen co\r\nbiochar, used t\r\ncalculate bioch\r\nTotal Nitrogen (N)\r\nNitrogen is a key\r\ncomponent that\r\ninfluences biochar's\r\nproperties and its\r\npotential applications,\r\nincluding its use as a soil\r\namendment.\r\nRequired - Measured\r\n% (weight\r\n/ weight)\r\nSection 3.3 in the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical dete\r\nof nitrogen con\r\nbiochar\r\nTotal Oxygen (O)\r\nMeasurement of O is\r\nrequired to calculate the\r\nratio, which is an\r\naddition metric of\r\nstability, used to confirm\r\nthe ratio.\r\nRequired - Measured\r\n% (weight\r\n/ weight)\r\nSection 3.3 in the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical dete\r\nof oxygen cont\r\nbiochar\r\nTotal Sulfur (S)\r\nSulfur is a key\r\ncomponent that\r\ninfluences biochar's\r\nproperties and its\r\npotential applications,\r\nincluding its use as a soil\r\namendment.\r\nRequired - Measured\r\n% (weight\r\n/ weight)\r\nSection 3.3 in the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical dete\r\nof sulfur conte\r\nbiochar\r\nCinorg\r\nCinorg\r\nCorg\r\nTotal Carbon Content\r\nCorg\r\nH/Corg\r\nO/Corg\r\nH/Corg\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 39/72"
