    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PARAMETER DESCRIPTION\r\nREQUIRED OR\r\nRECOMMENDED THRESHOLDS\r\nPARAMETER\r\nTYPE UNITS\r\nPROTOCOL OR MODULE\r\nREFERENCE DATA SOURCE\r\nNutrient availability\r\nConcentration of\r\nessential plant nutrients\r\nin forms that plants can\r\nreadily absorb\r\nRecommended - Measured -\r\nSection 5.2.2 of the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical mea\r\nof nutrients in\r\navailable to pla\r\nabsorption\r\nSoil Organic Carbon\r\n(SOC)\r\nIndicator of soil organic\r\nmatter and overall soil\r\nhealth\r\nRecommended - Measured\r\ng kg or\r\nppm\r\nSection 5.2.2 of the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments Module\r\nAnalytical mea\r\nof total organic\r\ncontent in soil\r\nCrop yield or farm\r\nprofitability data for\r\nthree years proceeding\r\nbiochar application\r\nTime series of crop yield\r\ndata\r\nRecommended - Measured\r\nVarious\r\naccepted\r\nSection 5.2.2 of the\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil\r\nEnvironments\r\nRecords of cro\r\ndata\r\n-1\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 52/72"
