      "type": "text",
      "text": "<PARSED TEXT FOR PAGE: 62 / 72>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Isometric would like to thank following contributors to this Module:\r\nMeredith Barr, Ph.D. (London South Bank University)\r\nSegun Oladele, Ph.D. (University of Lincoln)\r\n10.0\r\nAcknowledgements\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 62/72"
    },
