    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "This module is an expansion of the requirements from Biochar Storage in Agricultural Soils, and hence starts on version 1.2. Key requirement changes from\r\nBiochar Storage in Agricultural Soils version 1.1 include scope expanding beyond agricultural soils to include forestry soils and recreational areas; new\r\nprovisions for stockpiling, mixing with organic materials, and supply chain sales; updates to carbon fraction calculations and measurement guidance. Structural\r\nchange, module title updated to Biochar Storage in Soil Environments Module. Text formatting updates\r\nBiochar Storage in Soil Environments © 2025 Isometric HQ Ltd is licensed under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in Soil Environments v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-soil-environments/1.2 72/72"
    }
